Package: PlantVelocity
Title: Plant RNA Velocity with IR-Excluded Two-State Dynamics
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("PlantVelocity Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   email = "plantvelocity@example.com")
Description: PlantVelocity provides RNA velocity analysis for plant
    single-cell data using an intron-excluded two-state model of unspliced and
    spliced RNA. An independent intron-retention signal can be imported and
    smoothed for future statistical analysis but is excluded from dynamics
    recovery and velocity computation.
